WEBVTT

00:01:48.690 --> 00:01:50.130
<i>Die!</i>

00:01:50.130 --> 00:01:51.460
My left arm!

00:01:52.960 --> 00:01:53.950
<i>It jammed!</i>

00:01:56.430 --> 00:01:57.420
<i>Huh?</i>

00:02:28.770 --> 00:02:29.730
Huh?!

00:02:29.730 --> 00:02:31.130
It wasn't me?

00:02:33.040 --> 00:02:35.870
<i>I saved the Sunabouzu's life!</i>

00:02:39.410 --> 00:02:40.570
You!

00:02:44.880 --> 00:02:46.600
Who're you, again?

00:02:47.020 --> 00:02:50.020
<i>Taiko! Koizumi Taiko!</i>

00:02:52.930 --> 00:02:55.870
<i>You didn't notice me following you?</i>

00:02:55.870 --> 00:02:59.900
<i>That's what you get for working
before you're fully recovered!</i>

00:03:01.210 --> 00:03:04.300
<i>After all, you did get stranded!</i>

00:03:05.310 --> 00:03:07.510
<i>What a lost cause!</i>

00:03:07.510 --> 00:03:09.550
<i>You not only got stranded,
but had to be rescued</i>

00:03:09.550 --> 00:03:12.920
<i>by your rivals, the Kawaguchi brothers!</i>

00:03:12.920 --> 00:03:14.890
You're sure well-informed!

00:03:14.890 --> 00:03:17.090
<i>Well, you are my master!</i>

00:03:17.090 --> 00:03:20.660
Get lost! You'll never be my pupil,
even if you follow me everywhere!

00:03:20.660 --> 00:03:24.800
<i>No! I'll keep following you
even if you don't make me your pupil!</i>

00:03:24.800 --> 00:03:28.570
<i>Why do you wanna be my pupil anyway?!</i>

00:03:28.570 --> 00:03:30.770
<i>Isn't it obvious?</i>

00:03:30.770 --> 00:03:34.840
<i>To be stronger than any man!
To be more beautiful than anything!</i>

00:03:34.840 --> 00:03:39.470
<i>And to possess a wise and
clear intellect and beat up bad guys!</i>

00:03:41.580 --> 00:03:46.750
<i>Yes! To be the most skilled beauty
in the Great Kanto Desert!</i>

00:03:49.620 --> 00:03:54.460
<i>Oh, my future self is so wonderful!</i>

00:03:56.860 --> 00:04:00.200
<i>Hey! Wait for me, Master!</i>

00:04:01.070 --> 00:04:02.970
<i>"Water Station #30"</i>

00:04:01.470 --> 00:04:04.840
<i>- Welcome!
- Come on in!</i>

00:04:10.610 --> 00:04:14.350
<i>Yo, Kan-chan! Sounds like
you had a tough time! You ok?!</i>

00:04:14.350 --> 00:04:18.790
<i>Hey, Sunabouzu! Don't get yer ass stranded!</i>

00:04:18.790 --> 00:04:22.360
<i>Life's long, so all
kinds of things will happen!</i>

00:04:22.360 --> 00:04:26.230
<i>Don't listen to 'em,
even if you did get stranded!</i>

00:04:26.230 --> 00:04:29.230
<i>It's that Sunabouzu guy who got stranded!</i>

00:04:29.230 --> 00:04:31.380
<i>Let's go before we get dumb too!</i>

00:04:32.700 --> 00:04:34.970
<i>You're quite the celebrity, Master!</i>

00:04:34.970 --> 00:04:36.870
Why?! Why?!

00:04:36.870 --> 00:04:38.640
<i>The Sunabouzu?</i>

00:04:38.640 --> 00:04:42.310
<i>Yep! We saved his butt!</i>

00:04:42.310 --> 00:04:50.320
<i>The minute he saw us, he was all crying
and saying how he was saved!</i>

00:04:50.320 --> 00:04:53.890
Haruo! Are you the one spreading rumors?!

00:04:53.890 --> 00:04:55.060
Damn you!

00:04:55.060 --> 00:04:57.560
<i>Eh?! Despite being a handyman?!</i>

00:04:57.560 --> 00:04:59.860
<i>He's so completely pathetic.</i>

00:04:59.860 --> 00:05:04.660
<i>If he had any sense of shame,
he'd never set foot in this town again.</i>

00:05:05.870 --> 00:05:06.930
<i>How lame!</i>

00:05:06.930 --> 00:05:10.640
<i>He even pissed off the villagers
who hired him as a bodyguard!</i>

00:05:10.640 --> 00:05:13.540
<i>And then he gets stranded!</i>

00:05:13.540 --> 00:05:20.350
How dare you brothers
spread untrue rumors about me!

00:05:20.350 --> 00:05:22.550
What's so funny?! Huh?!

00:05:22.550 --> 00:05:25.450
<i>You know it's funny, loser!</i>

00:05:28.760 --> 00:05:32.860
<i>- How uncool!
- Yeah, loser!</i>

00:05:32.860 --> 00:05:36.490
This calls for another bomb
in their toilet!

00:05:37.160 --> 00:05:40.160
<i>Wow! That was pathetic, Master!</i>

00:05:41.300 --> 00:05:43.840
<i>Anyway, Master, about being your pupil...</i>

00:05:43.840 --> 00:05:46.070
<i>Oh! If it isn't Kanta-kun!</i>

00:05:47.570 --> 00:05:52.100
<i>I hear you had a rough time.
Are you all better now?</i>

00:05:52.950 --> 00:05:55.180
Oh, Mizuta-kun!

00:05:55.180 --> 00:05:56.950
<i>I'm so envious!</i>

00:05:56.950 --> 00:06:01.790
<i>How I'd love to live a life of
thrills and adventure as you do!</i>

00:06:01.790 --> 00:06:02.890
<i>No!</i>

00:06:02.890 --> 00:06:05.160
<i>Mizuta-kun! Don't do anything dangerous!</i>

00:06:05.160 --> 00:06:07.630
<i>Hey! You're too close to Wataru-san!</i>

00:06:07.630 --> 00:06:11.470
<i>Calling him by his given name?!
You suck-up!</i>

00:06:11.470 --> 00:06:15.600
<i>Come, now! Let's all just get along!</i>

00:06:18.610 --> 00:06:20.540
<i>See you later, Kanta-kun!</i>

00:06:20.540 --> 00:06:23.340
<i>You really must tell me
about your adventures sometime!</i>

00:06:24.510 --> 00:06:27.640
<i>Who was that pompous man?</i>

00:06:29.120 --> 00:06:31.720
<i>- Eh?</i>

00:06:29.120 --> 00:06:31.720
- I'm so jealous...

00:06:31.720 --> 00:06:34.520
Mizuta Wataru, 20, unemployed.

00:06:34.520 --> 00:06:37.260
Always has over 10 girlfriends.

00:06:37.260 --> 00:06:39.390
Also known as the Harem Prince.

00:06:39.390 --> 00:06:41.860
A miracle man who's
supported by his women!

00:06:41.860 --> 00:06:43.360
<i>Ick! How pathetic!</i>

00:06:43.360 --> 00:06:45.350
Fool! How can you say that?!

00:06:46.970 --> 00:06:52.410
Living every single day in happiness,
surrounded by gorgeous women!

00:06:52.410 --> 00:06:56.280
The ultimate male dream!
Such romanticism!

00:06:58.780 --> 00:07:00.080
<i>Lame.</i>

00:07:00.950 --> 00:07:03.250
<i>A real man...</i>

00:07:03.250 --> 00:07:05.990
<i>...works and fights as he sweats blood!</i>

00:07:05.990 --> 00:07:09.560
<i>He protects his family from the
cruel environment and vile fiends!</i>

00:07:09.560 --> 00:07:12.580
<i>He wins his food and brings it home!</i>

00:07:13.590 --> 00:07:15.990
<i>Ooh, oily!</i>

00:07:17.130 --> 00:07:20.800
<i>Yes, that is a real man!</i>

00:07:21.600 --> 00:07:24.050
You're hardcore in more ways than one...

00:07:28.310 --> 00:07:32.450
I'm not at full strength,
and now I'm a laughingstock...

00:07:32.450 --> 00:07:35.920
Man, I am so jealous of Mizuta-kun!

00:07:35.920 --> 00:07:40.450
<i>That's just it! If you make me
your pupil, you'll never be lonely!</i>

00:07:40.450 --> 00:07:43.190
<i>Plus I can help take care of you!</i>

00:07:43.190 --> 00:07:46.730
Maybe I'd consider one
of Mizuta-kun's hotties,

00:07:46.730 --> 00:07:50.790
but not some puny,
flat-chested runt like you!

00:07:52.870 --> 00:07:55.860
<i>It appears the time to show it has come!</i>

00:07:56.970 --> 00:08:00.470
Stop! I don't wanna see your no-boobs!

00:08:00.470 --> 00:08:01.870
<i>Here it is!</i>

00:08:05.510 --> 00:08:07.480
She's one hot mama!

00:08:07.480 --> 00:08:10.380
- W-who is she?!

00:08:07.480 --> 00:08:10.380
<i>- Isn’t she?</i>

00:08:10.380 --> 00:08:11.940
<i>My mother!</i>

00:08:13.750 --> 00:08:19.390
<i>Understand now? I'm the
daughter of this "hot mama"!</i>

00:08:19.390 --> 00:08:23.420
<i>Which means that I have
the same genes as her!</i>

00:08:34.710 --> 00:08:37.300
Alright! I'll test you!

00:08:39.380 --> 00:08:44.420
<i>- Get your bug dumplings here!
- 30% off all used items today!</i>

00:08:44.420 --> 00:08:48.390
<i>Exactly how are you
going to test me, Master?</i>

00:08:48.390 --> 00:08:49.560
Uh huh...

00:08:49.560 --> 00:08:51.760
<i>Master!</i>

00:08:51.760 --> 00:08:53.630
<i>Master?</i>

00:08:53.630 --> 00:08:54.490
<i>Master?!</i>

00:08:54.490 --> 00:08:56.530
<i>- I suppose...</i>

00:08:54.490 --> 00:08:56.530
- That alright?

00:08:56.530 --> 00:08:59.100
<i>Master! What're you doing? Why...</i>

00:08:59.100 --> 00:09:00.770
<i>- Eh?</i>

00:08:59.100 --> 00:09:00.770
