00:09:00.770 --> 00:09:02.870
<i>- Oh, is that her?
- Eh?</i>

00:09:02.870 --> 00:09:06.610
<i>She's a tiny one,
but there's plenty of work for her...</i>

00:09:06.610 --> 00:09:07.210
