00:09:29.900 --> 00:09:31.700
Then listen!

00:09:31.700 --> 00:09:36.940
Being a handyman is the coolest
and most hardcore job in the desert!

00:09:36.940 --> 00:09:40.970
Whether or not I make you my pupil
depends on how you handle it!

00:09:44.740 --> 00:09:49.320
<i>Understood! I'll do it! So I can
