00:10:17.980 --> 00:10:19.110
<i>Eh?!</i>

00:10:19.110 --> 00:10:24.520
<i>Oh? I'd heard handymen'll
do anythin' for money...</i>

00:10:24.520 --> 00:10:27.110
<i>A-all right!</i>

00:10:28.690 --> 00:10:33.750
This is the life!
Raking it in just sitting here!

00:10:35.860 --> 00:10:37.900
Yeah. Yeah!

00:10:37.900 --> 00:10:41.530
It's obvious why I've had
no luck with girls so far!

00:10:46.940 --> 00:10:51.510
They were all strong, independent women!

00:10:51.510 --> 00:10:54.450
But this time I'll take that
lower-than-garbage, genderless brat

00:10:54.450 --> 00:11:00.820
and reforge her mind, body, and spirit!

00:11:04.890 --> 00:11:08.160
<i>I can't reach the button in back...</i>

00:11:08.160 --> 00:11:11.460
I'll mold her into a
proficient assistant handyman!

00:11:16.200 --> 00:11:19.110
<i>Oh, you! Don't touch me there!</i>

00:11:19.110 --> 00:11:21.140
Sorry!

00:11:21.140 --> 00:11:26.080
I, with my own two hands,
shall raise my ideal woman!

00:11:28.680 --> 00:11:32.220
<i>- Oh, Wataru-san! Kiss me!
- No, me!</i>

00:11:32.220 --> 00:11:34.710
