gather all the ideal women I raised!

00:11:49.140 --> 00:11:54.040
In this desert, I shall build
an Amusement Land all my own!

00:12:14.160 --> 00:12:16.390
<i>Delivery for you!</i>

00:12:19.000 --> 00:12:21.400
<i>Delivery for you!!</i>

00:12:23.140 --> 00:12:26.540
<i>Delivery for you!!!</i>

00:12:26.540 --> 00:12:30.030
<i>Um, delivery from Hashimoto-san!</i>

00:12:31.040 --> 00:12:36.510
<i>Yes, this year I am 89 years old...</i>

00:12:45.630 --> 00:12:47.990
<i>I can't see inside!</i>

00:12:57.600 --> 00:13:01.470
<i>Hey, runt! Take this one too!</i>

00:13:10.320 --> 00:13:12.650
<i>This job'll be a cinch!</i>

00:13:12.650 --> 00:13:14.750
<i>Hey! Start shoutin' your spiel!</i>

00:13:14.750 --> 00:13:15.820
<i>Right!</i>

00:13:15.820 --> 00:13:19.690
<i>Come one, come all!
Always 30% to 40% off!</i>

00:13:19.690 --> 00:13:22.390
<i>The newly-renovated Insect Shop!</i>

00:13:26.770 --> 00:13:28.700
<i>Not loud enough.</i>

00:13:28.700 --> 00:13:32.370
<i>Right! Always 30% to 40% off!</i>

00:13:32.370 --> 00:13:33.410
<i>Can't hear you!</i>

00:13:33.410 --> 00:13:35.910
<i>The newly-renovated Insect Shop!</i>

00:13:35.910 --> 00:13:36.610
<i>Louder!</i>

00:13:36.610 --> 00:13:38.980
<i>Always 30% to 40% off!</i>

00:13:38.980 --> 00:13:40.880
<i>Say it louder!</i>

00:13:40.880 --> 00:13:43.750
<i>Um, there's no one around...</i>

00:13:43.750 --> 00:13:47.890
<i>I don't care! Now start from the top!</i>

00:13:47.890 --> 00:13:54.660
<i>Always 30% to 40% off!
The newly-renovated Insect Shop!</i>

00:13:54.660 --> 00:13:55.500
<i>Always 30% to...</i>

00:13:55.500 --> 00:13:58.030
<i>"Water Parlor"</i>

