00:14:51.080 --> 00:14:54.490
He was definitely
a top-class sharpshooter.

00:14:54.490 --> 00:14:57.660
He must've trained quite a lot.

00:14:57.660 --> 00:15:01.260
But that's all he had going for him.

00:15:01.260 --> 00:15:04.290
Yes! Fighting and living are the same!

00:15:05.230 --> 00:15:10.130
Ever-changing conditions!
Unpredictable storms of change!

00:15:11.300 --> 00:15:14.340
