00:18:51.590 --> 00:18:56.960
<i>Oh! Tama-chan! Did you
enjoy your little walkie?</i>

00:18:58.400 --> 00:19:00.570
<i>What are you doing?</i>

00:19:00.570 --> 00:19:02.440
You'll break, err, uh...

00:19:02.440 --> 00:19:05.840
- No!

00:19:02.440 --> 00:19:05.840
<i>- Hand her here this instant!</i>

00:19:16.280 --> 00:19:19.290
<i>What have you done
to my poor Tama-chan?!</i>

00:19:19.290 --> 00:19:21.650
I'm sorry! I'm sorry!

00:19:21.650 --> 00:19:24.660
<i>Tama-chan was pedigreed
and very expensive!</i>

00:19:24.660 --> 00:19:27.060
- Just endure it!

00:19:24.660 --> 00:19:27.060
<i>- What on earth do you
have to say for yourself?!</i>

00:19:27.060 --> 00:19:29.130
- It's for my big long-term plan!

00:19:27.060 --> 00:19:29.130
<i>- I did have my doubts, seeing as
you were stranded recently!</i>

00:19:29.130 --> 00:19:31.030
<i>I should've known better!</i>

00:19:31.030 --> 00:19:33.930
I'm sorry! I'm sorry!
I swear I'll make it up to you!

00:19:33.930 --> 00:19:37.100
On my honor as the Sunabozu!

00:19:49.520 --> 00:19:53.180
I'm in huge debt again...

00:19:55.190 --> 00:19:58.830
<i>Oh, if it isn't Kanta-kun!</i>

00:19:58.830 --> 00:20:01.390
<i>What're you doing here?</i>

00:20:03.860 --> 00:20:05.960
Oh, Mizuta-kun!

00:20:07.930 --> 00:20:10.370
Just watching the sun go down...

00:20:10.370 --> 00:20:11.960
<i>Ah...</i>

00:20:13.670 --> 00:20:17.040
<i>What a pretty sunset...</i>

00:20:17.040 --> 00:20:18.710
Yeah...

00:20:18.710 --> 00:20:23.420
You don't seem in very high spirits.
And what happened to your face?

00:20:23.420 --> 00:20:24.710
<i>Well, you see...</i>

00:20:26.190 --> 00:20:28.620
<i>I'll kill you first, and then me!</i>

00:20:28.620 --> 00:20:29.890
<i>Stop!</i>

00:20:29.890 --> 00:20:33.260
<i>So I was just your toy...</i>

00:20:33.260 --> 00:20:34.490
<i>And me...</i>

00:20:34.490 --> 00:20:35.830
<i>And me...</i>

00:20:35.830 --> 00:20:37.860
<i>And me...</i>

00:20:37.860 --> 00:20:42.600
<i>W-wait! I can explain!
My love is eternal!</i>

00:20:42.600 --> 00:20:45.330
<i>Eternal!</i>

00:20:47.510 --> 00:20:52.980
<i>I tried to love them all equally,
but things turned a bit sour...</i>

00:20:52.980 --> 00:20:54.750
I'd say more than "a bit"...

00:20:54.750 --> 00:20:58.620
<i>Whoops. I gotta go
apologize to lzumi-chan next.</i>

00:20:58.620 --> 00:21:00.720
<i>See you, Kanta-kun.</i>

00:21:00.720 --> 00:21:03.810
Yeah. See you later...

00:21:08.290 --> 00:21:13.430
Hmm. I guess even
Mizuta-kun has it tough...

00:21:21.310 --> 00:21:25.040
Yeah. I'll hafta work hard, too!

00:21:25.040 --> 00:21:26.880
For my dream...

00:21:37.990 --> 00:21:39.460
Found ya!

00:21:39.460 --> 00:21:45.100
<i>Soon after, people began to spot
an odd pair in the Great Kanto Desert.</i>

00:21:45.100 --> 00:21:47.770
Ok! We attack on my signal!

00:21:47.770 --> 00:21:49.260
<i>Right, Master!</i>

00:21:50.400 --> 00:21:52.470
<i>The Sunabozu and his pupil, Kosuna.</i>

00:21:52.470 --> 00:21:57.200
<i>But between them was
neither respect nor trust...</i>

00:21:59.050 --> 00:22:03.350
<i>...only revolting desires
and devious selfishness.</i>

00:22:03.350 --> 00:22:07.850
<i>May happiness come
to this wretched pair!</i>

00:22:07.850 --> 00:22:10.650
<i>- Right, Master!</i>

00:22:07.850 --> 00:22:10.650
- Let's do it, Kosuna!

00:23:55.990 --> 00:23:57.690
<i>Yo! Ghost of the Desert, Sunabozu here!</i>

00:23:57.690 --> 00:24:00.400
<i>Sorry about this episode!
There were no boobies to be had!</i>

00:24:00.400 --> 00:24:03.630
<i>That's all right, Master!
Having none has its advantages, too!</i>

00:24:03.630 --> 00:24:05.940
<i>- You're hopeless...</i>

00:24:03.630 --> 00:24:05.940
<i>- Like that makes me any happier!</i>

00:24:05.940 --> 00:24:08.200
<i>On the next Sunabozu-
"Dog-Girl and Rock"</i>

00:24:08.200 --> 00:24:10.670
<i>Miss it and there'll be
even less boobies!</i>
